Analysis: Excellent! All tests pass. Let me also think about whether I need to verify edge target existence more carefully. Looking at my code:

```js
const stack = [...graph.nodes];
while (stack.length > 0) {
  const current = stack.pop()!;
  for (const edge of current.edges) {
    if (!ids.has(edge.id)) {
      return ctx.mustBe(...);
    }
